ent-SunriseDiseaseVaccine = vaccine
    .desc = A single-use injector. Cures the loaded strain and protects against catching it again.
ent-SunriseDiseaseSerum = serum
    .desc = A single-use injector made from the blood of a recovered donor. Treats the illness but grants no protection.
ent-SunriseDiseaseFailedVaccine = spoiled serum
    .desc = A cloudy ampoule of useless protein sludge. The antigen did not match.
ent-SunrisePillAntitussive = pill
    .suffix = Antitussive, 20u
    .desc = { ent-Pill.desc }
ent-SunrisePillCanisterAntitussive = pill canister
    .suffix = Antitussive, 5
    .desc = { ent-PillCanister.desc }
ent-SunrisePillAntimicrobial = pill
    .suffix = Antimicrobial, 20u
    .desc = { ent-Pill.desc }
ent-SunrisePillCanisterAntimicrobial = pill canister
    .suffix = Antimicrobial, 5
    .desc = { ent-PillCanister.desc }
ent-SunriseCrateEpidemicResponse = epidemic response crate
    .desc = Swabs, suppressants and protective masks for an outbreak.
ent-SunriseDiseaseDiagnoser = disease diagnoser
    .desc = Analyzes a disease sample and prints a report.
ent-SunriseVaccinator = vaccinator
    .desc = Synthesizes vaccines from antigens and extracts serum from donor blood.
ent-SunriseDiagnosisReportPaper = disease diagnoser report
    .desc = A chilling medical receipt.
ent-SunrisePetriDish = petri dish
    .desc = A sterile dish with nutrient medium. Inoculate it with a sample and wait for the culture to grow.
ent-SunrisePetriDishBox = petri dish dispenser
    .desc = Dispenses sterile petri dishes for growing cultures.
ent-SunriseDiseaseStrainVial = strain sample
    .desc = A sealed vial with a lab sample of a strain. Useless as an infection source, but a culture grows from it.
ent-SunriseDiseaseDatabaseConsole = virus database console
    .desc = Keeps everything the station knows about known strains and dispenses lab samples of them.
ent-SunriseDiseaseDatabaseCircuitboard = virus database console board
    .desc = A computer printed circuit board for a virus database console.
ent-SunriseDiseaseCloud = strange haze
    .desc = A cloud of sticky haze. Breathing it in seems like a bad idea.
ent-SunriseDiseaseCloudBreach = dense culture haze
    .desc = A thick, glistening fog of escaped culture. It clings to everything.
ent-SunriseCrateContaminatedAid = { ent-CrateMedicalSupplies }
    .suffix = Contaminated
    .desc = { ent-CrateMedicalSupplies.desc }
ent-SunriseCrateContaminatedBiowaste = biowaste crate
    .desc = A sealed crate of medical waste. The seal does not look intact.
