ent-SunriseDiseaseScanner = disease analyzer
    .desc = A hand-held analyzer that checks an object or a person for an infection and prints the report on the spot. Runs on paper.
ent-SunriseDiseaseSprayer = disinfectant sprayer
    .suffix = Filled
    .desc = A pressurized sprayer of disinfectant. Kills the contagion on contaminated items and on the dead, and does nothing for the living - that is what a vaccine is for.
ent-SunriseClothingEyesHudVirology = virology hud
    .desc = A heads-up display that highlights contaminated items nearby. It cannot tell what they carry and does not see infection in living people.
